        <div class="audience">
          <div class="aud-card">
            <div class="role">For residents &amp; advocates</div>
            <h3>Measure your street.</h3>
            <p>You do not need to be a developer. Flash the Pi image once, aim it out of a window, leave it for a week, and walk into the next meeting with numbers instead of a story.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Flash the Raspberry Pi image once. After setup, the main workflow lives in the web dashboard</li>
              <li>Council-ready PDF with speed distributions, hourly patterns, and percentiles</li>
              <li>Privacy by design: radar only, no faces, no plates, and no cloud account</li>
              <li>Community help with mounting, aiming, and making the case</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="aud-cta">
              <a href="{{ release.rpi_image.url }}" class="btn btn-primary">
