              <a href="/guides/setup/" class="btn btn-ghost">Setup guide →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="aud-card contributor">
            <div class="role">For engineers &amp; researchers</div>
            <h3>Help us see the street.</h3>
            <p>The radar pipeline is the most mature part of the project. The LiDAR pipeline is open and still calibrating. Geometry, tracking, and classification all have real open questions, and all welcome pull requests.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Open-source pipeline, published maths, and a public open-questions list</li>
              <li>LiDAR research preview: point clouds, tracking, classification</li>
